<details class='sub-section' id='sub_2'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>03 · 压抑、忍受、激发与着迷 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'>Bottling up, Putting up with & Stirring up</span></span><span class='sub-meta'>101 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>🎭 <b>场景认知导读：</b>将情绪封锁在瓶内是压抑（bottle up），将海底沉淀物搅动升起是激起情绪（stir/whip up）。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
