<details class='sub-section' id='sub_3'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>04 · 令人生畏、失望、羞辱与鼓舞 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'>Letting down, Putting off & Psyching up</span></span><span class='sub-meta'>65 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>🎭 <b>场景认知导读：</b>原本托举支持某人却突然松手任其跌落即为辜负/使失望（let down）；将某人心理能量充满推高即为鼓舞（psych/buoy up）。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>turn <span class='pt-highlight'>out</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 12 个核心义项'>1/12</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：标准通用语域 (对应: prove)' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>be shown or be found to be</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>prove</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>She proved to be right.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>The medicine <b>turned</b> <b>out</b> to save her life.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>③</span>She turned up HIV positive.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>turn <span class='pt-highlight'>out</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 12 个核心义项'>2/12</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：作为正式词 [produce] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>produce quickly or regularly, usually with machinery</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>produce, create</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>This factory <b>turns</b> <b>out</b> saws.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>turn <span class='pt-highlight'>out</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 12 个核心义项'>3/12</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：标准通用语域 (对应: hap)' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>prove to be in the result or end</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>hap</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>It <b>turns</b> <b>out</b> that he was right.</div></div></div></td></tr>
